# EXPERIMENTAL: auto-start suppression, NOT an execution or security boundary.
# "stop" marks an unstarted init service disabled. This action follows the
# system rc's slot_suffix enable action, before late_start on the tested build.
# An explicit privileged start/enable can defeat it. Re-review any init change.
# No package, UI, policy or executable is modified. Remove and rebuild vendor
# to reverse on next boot. Downloads, recovery and Mainline are not contained.
on early-init
    stop update_engine

on property:ro.boot.slot_suffix=*
    stop update_engine
